  "title": "Qin Straight Road",
  "summary": "The first emperor's military road, the Straight Road (Qinzhidao), was begun in 212 BCE and finished five years later by Sima Qian's account. It ran roughly 900 km from Yunyang near Xianyang north to Jiuyuan, now Baotou, letting troops and orders reach the northern frontier. A 13 km section was identified in Yulin in 2025.",
